planation\": \"No typos were found in critical identifiers, file paths, commands, or variable names.\"}, \"difficulty_explanation_quality\": {\"outcome\": \"fail\", \"explanation\": \"The difficulty_explanation metadata field is missing in task.toml.\"}, \"solution_explanation_quality\": {\"outcome\": \"fail\", \"explanation\": \"The s"]
